# Force LF line endings in the working tree on every OS. Biome formats with
# LF; without this, git on Windows converts to CRLF on checkout and the next
# `npm run lint` reports a full-file formatter diff. (This repo has no CI --
# release.sh step 1 is the only lint gate -- so that diff surfaces at release
# time rather than on a PR.)
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary markers so git doesn't try to normalize them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
